<title>USA: Whitney, First National to merge.</title>
<headline>Whitney, First National to merge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whitney Holding Corp and First National Bankshares Inc, Houma, La., said late Friday that they have signed a definitive agreement to merge.</p>
<p>The companies said that shareholders of First National will receive about $20.32 per share in Whitney stock.</p>
<p>They said they expect the merger, which is valued at $41 million, to be completed during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
